About INET Showcases
====================

This folder contains the INET showcase simulations and the source code of their
associated web pages. Media files (images and videos) for the pages are
in a separate repository (https://github.com/inet-framework/media)
to keep the core INET repository small; the documentation build uses a checkout
under $INET/media if there is one, and downloads it otherwise.

See $INET/doc/src/README.md for building the documentation, e.g. only the
tutorials: doc/src/build --only tutorials --serve


